exists su name qwen say tone promptify instruction ob text quoted.text.Return exactly one single-line speaking direction sentence for TTS.

Required shape:
Tone words, pace phrase, articulation phrase, pause phrase, emphasis phrase.

Rules:
1. One line only, plain text.
2. No labels, bullets, code fences, or extra commentary.
3. Do not mention instruction/current_cut/previous_cut/full_script field names.
4. Keep it under 22 words.
5. Prefer warm teacher style unless urgency is explicit.

Example output (single line):
Warm friendly teacher, moderate pace, crisp articulation, brief pauses after key terms, gentle emphasis..text.quoted be text ya
