  su name section clip series stage from name teaching sections by name teaching video section footnote mapper to name text teaching section clips be series map do
  su name section clip manifest write stage ob name section clip series stage to filename of ob of section clip manifest filename stage be write do

  su name final concatenate stage from name teaching section clips fromstate wo itinerary become wo video be concatenate do
  su name opening heading stage from filename of ob of final concatenate stage with name text video heading to filename of ob of final concatenate stage by num of ob of video heading y ratio stage be video heading burn do

  su name draw discharge stage as wo draw be discharge do

  su name result ob filename of ob of opening heading stage be teaching video ya
